<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>CEVICO — Cuidados Oculares | Cirurgia refrativa e catarata em São Paulo</title>
  <meta name="description" content="<%= @hub['tagline'].presence || 'CEVICO Cuidados Oculares em São Paulo. Cirurgia refrativa a laser (miopia, astigmatismo e hipermetropia) e cirurgia de catarata com lente trifocal. Avaliação com equipe própria na Av. Paulista e no Tatuapé.' %>">
  <link rel="canonical" href="<%= Cevico::PublicSite.base_url %>/">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFFFFF">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="pt_BR">
  <meta property="og:title" content="CEVICO — Cuidados Oculares">
  <meta property="og:description" content="<%= @hub['tagline'].presence || 'Cirurgia refrativa a laser e catarata com lente trifocal em São Paulo.' %>">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="CEVICO — Cuidados Oculares">
  <meta property="og:url" content="<%= Cevico::PublicSite.base_url %>/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="<%= Cevico::PublicSite.base_url %>/brand-assets/cevico-logo.png">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand-assets/cevico-eye.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/brand-assets/cevico-eye.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "MedicalClinic",
    "name": "CEVICO — Cuidados Oculares",
    "url": "<%= Cevico::PublicSite.base_url %>/",
    "medicalSpecialty": "Ophthalmologic",
    "telephone": "+55 11 99165-1628",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "streetAddress": "Av. Paulista, 1499 — 9º andar",
      "addressLocality": "São Paulo",
      "addressRegion": "SP",
      "postalCode": "01311-200",
      "addressCountry": "BR"
    },
    "department": [
      { "@type": "MedicalClinic", "name": "CEVICO — Unidade Av. Paulista" },
      {
        "@type": "MedicalClinic",
        "name": "CEVICO — Unidade Tatuapé",
        "address": {
          "@type": "PostalAddress",
          "streetAddress": "R. Serra de Botucatu, 880 — 4º andar",
          "addressLocality": "São Paulo",
          "addressRegion": "SP",
          "addressCountry": "BR"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <style>
  /* ====== CEVICO — porta de entrada · estética "Apple das clínicas" ======
     Uma dobra só: placa navy da marca, a pergunta e os caminhos.
     Branco, respiro, hairlines. Navy e ouro como autoridade;
     laranja só na seta que puxa o clique.                                 */
  :root{
    --navy:#152C61;
    --navy-deep:#0E1F47;
    --gold:#D4AF37;
    --ink:#0F1B38;
    --ink-soft:#5A6478;
    --hair:#E4E7EE;
    --canvas:#FFFFFF;
    --pop:#FF5722;
    --royal:#1D4ED8;
    --royal-2:#2563EB;
    --sans:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "Inter", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    --radius:22px;
    --shadow-card:0 2px 10px rgba(15,27,56,.05);
    --shadow-float:0 24px 60px rgba(15,27,56,.12);
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
  body{
    font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--canvas);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
    min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    padding:clamp(24px,5vh,48px) 20px;
    position:relative;overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  body::before{
    content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1000px 520px at 50% -14%, rgba(37,99,235,.10), transparent 68%),
      radial-gradient(760px 420px at 50% 118%, rgba(212,175,55,.09), transparent 70%);
  }
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}

  .hub{width:100%;max-width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center}

  .plate{
    display:block;width:clamp(196px,54vw,236px);
    border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(21,44,97,.20);
  }
  .plate img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}

  .rule{
    width:44px;height:2px;border-radius:2px;margin:clamp(20px,3.4vh,28px) 0 0;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8A6620,#C9A24B,#F5E9B8,#D4AF37);
    opacity:.9;
  }

  h1{
    font-size:clamp(1.72rem,5.4vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;
    font-weight:800;margin-top:clamp(16px,2.6vh,22px);text-wrap:balance;
  }
  h1 span{
    background:linear-gradient(105deg,var(--navy) 5%,var(--royal-2) 45%,var(--pop) 92%);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .lead{
    color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:clamp(.98rem,2.5vw,1.08rem);line-height:1.55;
    margin-top:12px;max-width:29em;text-wrap:balance;
  }

  .paths{width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-top:clamp(26px,4.2vh,38px)}
  .path{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;text-align:left;
    background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hair);border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);
    transition:transform .28s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), box-shadow .28s ease, border-color .28s ease;
  }
  .path:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);border-color:#D5DCEA}
  .path:active{transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .path:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--royal);outline-offset:3px}

  .ico{flex:none;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;display:grid;place-items:center}
  .ico svg{width:26px;height:26px;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:1.7;fill:none;
    stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .ico-laser{background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--royal),var(--royal-2) 70%,#38BDF8);
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(29,78,216,.32)}
  .ico-lente{background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--navy-deep),var(--navy));
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(21,44,97,.28)}
  .ico-lente svg{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:1.6}

  .path-txt{flex:1;min-width:0}
  .path-txt strong{display:block;font-size:1.06rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.25}
  .path-txt small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:balance}
  .chev{flex:none;color:var(--pop);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;transition:transform .28s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
  .path:hover .chev{transform:translateX(4px)}

  .whats{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-top:clamp(20px,3.2vh,26px);
    font-size:.94rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);
    padding:11px 22px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--hair);background:#fff;
    transition:border-color .25s ease,color .25s ease,transform .25s ease;
  }
  .whats svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:#25D366}
  .whats:hover{border-color:#C9D3E6;transform:translateY(-2px)}

  footer{
    margin-top:clamp(22px,3.6vh,32px);
    color:#8A93A6;font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:34em;text-align:center;
  }

  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);filter:blur(8px);
      animation:reveal .8s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) forwards}
    .reveal:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.05s}
    .reveal:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.13s}
    .reveal:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.19s}
    .reveal:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.25s}
    .reveal:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.33s}
    .reveal:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.45s}
    .reveal:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.55s}
    @keyframes reveal{to{opacity:1;transform:none;filter:blur(0)}}
  }
  /* telas baixas (iPhone SE, navegador in-app do Instagram): comprime o
     respiro para a dobra continuar sendo UMA só */
  @media(max-height:720px){
    body{padding:20px}
    .plate{width:clamp(176px,46vw,204px)}
    .rule{margin-top:16px}
    h1{margin-top:12px;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,5vw,2.2rem)}
    .lead{margin-top:9px;font-size:.95rem}
    .paths{margin-top:20px;gap:12px}
    .whats{margin-top:16px;padding:10px 20px}
    footer{margin-top:16px;font-size:.7rem}
  }
  @media(max-width:400px){
    .path{padding:16px;gap:13px}
    .ico{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px}
    .ico svg{width:23px;height:23px}
    .path-txt strong{font-size:1rem}
  }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<main class="hub">

  <span class="plate reveal">
    <img src="/brand-assets/cevico-logo.png" alt="CEVICO — Cuidados Oculares" width="626" height="212">
  </span>

  <span class="rule reveal" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <h1 class="reveal">Você se interessa mais<br><span>por qual procedimento?</span></h1>

  <p class="lead reveal">
    <%= @hub['tagline'].presence || 'Escolha o assunto e veja, com calma, como a CEVICO cuida de cada caso.' %>
  </p>

  <%# ── as portas: página publicada quando existe; senão, WhatsApp com o assunto ── %>
  <nav class="paths reveal" aria-label="Procedimentos">
    <% @doors.each do |door| %>
      <% href = if door[:page_slug]
                  Cevico::PublicSite.page_url(door[:page_slug])
                elsif @hub['whatsapp'].present?
                  "https://wa.me/#{@hub['whatsapp']}?text=#{ERB::Util.url_encode(door[:whats])}"
                end %>
      <% next if href.blank? %>
      <a class="path" href="<%= href %>" rel="noopener">
        <span class="ico ico-<%= door[:icon] %>" aria-hidden="true">
          <% if door[:icon] == :laser %>
            <%# o raio no lugar da pupila: o laser em si %>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M2.5 12S6.1 6 12 6s9.5 6 9.5 6-3.6 6-9.5 6-9.5-6-9.5-6Z"/>
              <path d="M12.9 8.6 10.3 12.4h2.2l-1 3 2.6-3.9h-2.2z"/>
            </svg>
          <% else %>
            <%# diafragma: a lente que abre o foco em todas as distâncias %>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.4"/>
              <path d="M14.31 8l5.13 8.88"/>
              <path d="M9.69 8h10.26"/>
              <path d="M7.38 12l5.13-8.88"/>
              <path d="M9.69 16 4.56 7.12"/>
              <path d="M14.31 16H4.05"/>
              <path d="M16.62 12l-5.13 8.88"/>
            </svg>
          <% end %>
        </span>
        <span class="path-txt">
          <strong><%= door[:title] %></strong>
          <small><%= door[:text] %></small>
        </span>
        <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    <% end %>
  </nav>

  <% if @hub_whatsapp %>
    <a class="whats reveal" href="<%= @hub_whatsapp %>" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91S17.5 2 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.13c-.25.69-1.44 1.31-1.99 1.36-.53.05-1.03.24-3.46-.72-2.91-1.15-4.75-4.13-4.9-4.32-.14-.19-1.16-1.55-1.16-2.95s.73-2.09 1-2.38c.26-.29.57-.36.76-.36.19 0 .38 0 .55.01.18.01.41-.07.64.49.24.57.81 1.97.88 2.11.07.14.12.31.02.5-.09.19-.14.31-.28.48-.14.17-.29.37-.42.5-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.29.71 1.17 1.53 1.9 1.05.94 1.94 1.23 2.22 1.37.28.14.44.12.6-.07.17-.19.69-.81.88-1.09.19-.29.38-.24.64-.14.26.09 1.65.78 1.94.92.28.14.47.21.54.33.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"/></svg>
      Prefiro falar no WhatsApp
    </a>
  <% end %>

  <footer class="reveal">
    CEVICO Cuidados Oculares © <%= Time.current.year %> · Av. Paulista, 1499 e R. Serra de Botucatu, 880 — São Paulo/SP<br>
    Resultados variam de pessoa para pessoa; a indicação cirúrgica é confirmada em avaliação médica.
  </footer>

</main>

<%# rastreio do hub: origem viaja pras páginas; WhatsApp ganha Protocolo %>
<%= render 'cevico_pages/analytics_snippet', page: nil %>
<%= render 'cevico_pages/tracking_snippet', page: nil %>
</body>
</html>
